  "description": "The generic hearing room after the action: the chart on the display board with its reference, its supplied span marked and connected to the specialist's explanation card with its caption. A lens (a window with a rim, distinct from the board's card) opens on the card (a real enlarged copy of the same room coordinates) and one supplied datum is substituted: the span the explanation refers to (its caption). The old value moves, unchanged, to a dock as \"was\"; the new value arrives; only its dependent geometry follows (the band on the chart, the card's line and the connector). The context returns with a neutral changed-datum marker. Fictional data; the interpretation is neither right nor wrong; no rule, weight or outcome.",
